<section class="hud-shell">
<header class="hud-header"><span>STARCRAFT // NPC DATABASE</span><strong>UNIFIED NPC SHEET</strong></header>
<div class="hud-identity hud-identity-simple"><img src="{{actor.img}}" alt="NPC portrait"/><div><label>NPC Name<input name="name" value="{{actor.name}}"/></label><label>Faction<input name="system.faction" value="{{s.faction}}"/></label></div></div>
<div class="hud-tab-content">
<section class="hud-panel"><h3>IDENTITY</h3><div class="hud-npc-grid"><label>Species<select name="system.species"><option value="{{s.species}}">{{s.species}}</option><option value="terran">Terran</option><option value="zerg">Zerg</option><option value="protoss">Protoss</option><option value="other">Other</option></select></label><label>Role<input name="system.role" value="{{s.role}}"/></label><label>Level<input type="number" name="system.level" value="{{s.level}}" min="1"/></label></div></section>
<section class="hud-panel"><h3>VITALS</h3><div class="hud-npc-grid"><label>HP<input type="number" name="system.resources.hp.value" value="{{s.resources.hp.value}}"/></label><label>Max HP<input type="number" name="system.resources.hp.max" value="{{s.resources.hp.max}}"/></label><label>Shields<input type="number" name="system.resources.shields.value" value="{{s.resources.shields.value}}"/></label><label>Max Shields<input type="number" name="system.resources.shields.max" value="{{s.resources.shields.max}}"/></label><label>Protection<input type="number" name="system.resources.protection" value="{{s.resources.protection}}"/></label><label>Pending Wounds<input type="number" name="system.resources.woundsPending" value="{{s.resources.woundsPending}}"/></label></div></section>
<section class="hud-panel"><h3>CHARGING DEFENSE</h3><p>Charging: {{#if chargingDefense}}ACTIVE — Defense −2; flat-footed; cannot evade{{else}}Inactive{{/if}}</p>{{#if chargingDefense}}<button type="button" data-action="toggleChargingDefense">End Charge Penalties (Start of Next Turn)</button>{{/if}}</section><section class="hud-panel"><h3>DEFENSES</h3><p class="hud-help">Effective Defense (after wounds): {{effectiveDefenses.defense}} · Effective DR (after wounds): {{effectiveDefenses.damageResistance}}. Fields below are unmodified base values.</p><div class="hud-npc-grid">{{#each s.defenses as |value key|}}<label>{{key}}<input type="number" name="system.defenses.{{key}}" value="{{value}}"/></label>{{/each}}</div></section>
<section class="hud-panel"><h3>ATTRIBUTES</h3><div class="hud-npc-grid">{{#each s.attributes as |value key|}}<label>{{key}}<input type="number" name="system.attributes.{{key}}" value="{{value}}"/></label>{{/each}}<label>Melee Ranks<input type="number" name="system.prowess.melee" value="{{s.prowess.melee}}"/></label><label>Ranged Ranks<input type="number" name="system.prowess.ranged" value="{{s.prowess.ranged}}"/></label></div></section>
<section class="hud-panel"><h3>WEAPONS</h3><button type="button" data-action="pushTarget">Push (Special Combat Action)</button><label class="hud-help">Charge (full-round; +5 accuracy, melee +10 damage) <input type="checkbox" data-npc-charge/></label><label class="hud-help">Action Move (full-round, −2 accuracy) <input type="checkbox" data-npc-action-move/></label><p class="hud-help">Target one Terran or NPC token to calculate hits and preview damage. Weapon attack rolls use the same standard rate-of-fire calculations as Terrans. Drag weapon items onto this NPC to add attacks.</p>
{{#each items}}<div class="hud-npc-weapon"><div><strong>{{name}}</strong><small>{{range}} · {{rate}}</small><div data-npc-weapon-preview data-base-accuracy="{{attack.accuracy}}" data-base-damage="{{attack.damage}}" data-melee="{{attack.melee}}">Accuracy <b data-preview-accuracy>{{attack.accuracy}}</b> · Strikes {{attack.strikes}} · Damage <b data-preview-damage>{{attack.damage}}</b>{{#if attack.requiresAmmo}} · Ammo {{attack.ammo}}/{{attack.capacity}}{{/if}}</div></div>
<div class="hud-npc-weapon-actions"><button type="button" data-action="disarmWeapon" data-item-id="{{id}}">Disarm</button><button type="button" data-action="rollNpcAttack" data-item-id="{{id}}" {{#unless attack.canFire}}disabled{{/unless}}>Attack</button><button type="button" data-action="reloadNpcWeapon" data-item-id="{{id}}" {{#unless attack.requiresAmmo}}disabled{{/unless}}>Reload</button></div></div>{{else}}<p class="hud-help">No weapons yet.</p>{{/each}}</section>
<section class="hud-panel"><h3>MANUAL DAMAGE</h3><p class="hud-help">Physical damage after attack overages. Review and confirm before applying. Special traits still require GM adjudication.</p><div class="hud-damage-fields"><label>Damage<input type="number" min="0" value="0" data-npc-damage/></label><button type="button" data-action="applyNpcDamage">Review &amp; Apply</button></div></section>
<section class="hud-panel sc-wounds"><h3>CRIPPLING WOUNDS</h3><p class="hud-help">Immediate Core/Critical damage and Vital Bleed apply when pending wounds resolve. Bleed damage is applied manually at turn start to avoid duplicate ticks. Prone status and one-handed item selection are automated.</p><div class="hud-damage-fields"><strong>Bleed: {{woundConditions.bleed}}</strong><button type="button" data-action="applyBleedTick">Apply Bleed (Turn Start)</button><strong>Prone recorded: {{woundConditions.prone}}</strong></div>{{#if isGM}}<div class="hud-damage-fields"><label>GM Bleed<input type="number" min="0" value="{{woundConditions.bleed}}" data-wound-condition="bleed"/></label><button type="button" data-action="setWoundCondition" data-condition="bleed">Set Bleed</button><label>Prone<input type="checkbox" {{#if woundConditions.prone}}checked{{/if}} data-wound-condition="prone"/></label><button type="button" data-action="setWoundCondition" data-condition="prone">Set Prone</button></div>{{/if}}<p class="hud-help">Resolve pending wounds after damage. Standard attacks roll one location for all wound points. Immediate effects and ongoing penalties are applied automatically; the GM adjudicates permanent injuries and death.</p><button type="button" data-action="resolveWounds">Roll Pending Wound Location</button><div class="hud-npc-grid">{{#each woundRows}}<div class="sc-wound-row"><strong>{{label}}: {{points}}</strong><small>{{immediate}}</small><small>{{ongoing}}</small>{{#if ../isGM}}<input type="number" min="0" value="{{points}}" data-wound-points="{{key}}"/><button type="button" data-action="adjustWound" data-location="{{key}}">GM Set</button>{{/if}}</div>{{/each}}</div><h4>Recent Wound History</h4>{{#each woundHistory}}<p class="hud-help">{{location}}: {{points}} ({{source}}) {{#if override}}[GM override]{{/if}}</p>{{else}}<p class="hud-help">No recorded wounds.</p>{{/each}}</section><section class="hud-panel sc-permanent-injuries"><h3>PERMANENT INJURIES &amp; DEATH</h3><p class="hud-help">Mobility/Action wound points above 4 create permanent injury records. Core/Vital/Critical at 5+ marks the actor deceased. The GM determines anatomy and narrative consequences. These records persist when wound points are healed.</p><p><strong>Status: {{#if permanentWounds.deceased}}DECEASED{{else}}Alive / not marked deceased{{/if}}</strong></p>{{#if isGM}}<div class="hud-damage-fields"><label>Deceased <input type="checkbox" data-permanent-deceased {{#if permanentWounds.deceased}}checked{{/if}}/></label><button type="button" data-action="setDeceased">GM Set Status</button></div>{{/if}}<h4>Recorded Maiming Injuries</h4>{{#each permanentWounds.injuries}}<div class="sc-wound-row"><strong>{{location}} injury</strong>{{#if ../isGM}}<input type="text" maxlength="500" value="{{description}}" data-permanent-injury="{{id}}"/><button type="button" data-action="editPermanentInjury" data-injury-id="{{id}}">Save Description</button><button type="button" data-action="removePermanentInjury" data-injury-id="{{id}}">Remove Injury</button>{{else}}<p>{{description}}</p>{{/if}}</div>{{else}}<p class="hud-help">No permanent injuries recorded.</p>{{/each}}</section><section class="hud-panel"><h3>GM NOTES</h3><textarea name="system.notes" rows="6">{{s.notes}}</textarea></section>
</div></section>